	IL_001f: ldloca.s 0
	IL_0021: call instance int32 MyBenchmarks.MyStruct::get_B()
	IL_0026: call void [System.Console]System.Console::WriteLine(int32)
```

So it copies the struct, and sets the property. I tried it on .NET Framework as well.
